<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Token Radar ranks 460 pre-token DeFi protocols by the implied value of their eventual token, with a seven-step farm plan for every row.">
<title>Token Radar — which pre-token protocol is worth farming next</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
</head>
<body>
<header class="top">
  <div class="brand">
    <span class="pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div>
      <h1>Token Radar</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Which pre-token protocol is worth farming next — and what to do about it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="stats" id="stats"></div>
</header>

<main>
  <noscript><p class="empty">Token Radar needs JavaScript: the board is rendered from <code>data.js</code> in your browser.</p></noscript>
  <section class="controls" aria-label="Board controls">
    <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search a protocol…" autocomplete="off">
    <div class="chips" id="verdict-chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter by verdict">
      <button data-verdict="" class="chip active">All</button>
      <button data-verdict="FARM" class="chip farm">FARM</button>
      <button data-verdict="THIN" class="chip thin">THIN</button>
      <button data-verdict="SKIP" class="chip skip">SKIP</button>
    </div>
    <select id="category-filter" aria-label="Filter by category">
      <option value="">All categories</option>
    </select>
    <select id="chain-filter" aria-label="Filter by chain">
      <option value="">All chains</option>
    </select>
  </section>

  <section id="detail" class="detail" hidden aria-live="polite"></section>

  <p class="count" id="count"></p>

  <table class="board">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th data-sort="rank" class="num sorted">#</th>
        <th data-sort="name">Protocol</th>
        <th data-sort="category">Category</th>
        <th>Chains</th>
        <th data-sort="tvl" class="num">TVL</th>
        <th data-sort="change7d" class="num">7d</th>
        <th data-sort="implied" class="num">Implied value</th>
        <th data-sort="confidence">Confidence</th>
        <th data-sort="verdict">Verdict</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
  </table>

  <p class="empty" id="empty" hidden>No protocol matches these filters.</p>
</main>

<footer>
  <p>Implied values are this radar's own claim about what a protocol's token would be
  worth if its record stayed as it is. They are not a prediction that a token will be
  issued, or when. Data: DefiLlama snapshot, 2026-11-14; market evidence: CoinGecko,
  2026-11-21. A protocol that records no token may still have one — check before you farm.</p>
</footer>

<script src="../data.js"></script>
<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```
